From 4050e86a722df92b3aa6c64ad35f49160bde09ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 05:08:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign UI with the Organic design system

Replace the Bootstrap/purple-gradient UI with the Organic design system
from the Claude Design handoff: cream/terracotta/sage palette, RTL Hebrew
with Suez One headings over Assistant body text, and lucide-react icons.

- Persistent header with logo, nav links, and add-recipe button
- Recipe browser: "recipe of the week" hero, search, sort, tag filters,
  and a favorites toggle persisted in localStorage
- Recipe view: checkable ingredients, restyled steps/gallery, and a new
  step-by-step cook mode (route /recipe/:id/cook)
- Recipe editor: restyled with chip-style tags, same submit logic

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R3AycRPpHH117cXhzwfJcQ
